    "created_at": "2015-08-28T18:04:22Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-08-28T18:04:22Z",
    "body": "Oh, and to be clear what IDL does for an `optional boolean` argument is the following:\n\n```\nundefined -> \"not passed\"\nAny other value \"arg\" -> ToBoolean(arg)\n```\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
