    "updated_at": "2015-08-28T21:51:14Z",
    "body": "I guess we can close the issue since the spec is OK and non-Firefox browsers should update their behavior? Or do we want to first check if this is mobile-web-compatible or something?\n\n(BTW, after today I can recognize each of Chrome, Firefox, Safari, Edge & IE 11 just by checking results of various `classList`/`className`-related tests...)\n",
